Subject: [PATCH 3/3] model : add Kolibri-1 (Aleph-Alpha) support (#30673)

Port 62318cd57 onto the mesh-llm llama.cpp pin. GGUF-conversion python is omitted, including the qwen2/gpt-4o tokenizer hash entries those converters need; the pinned tree needs load and staged-graph support.
